2026-07-27T11:09:36.1934707Z i /tmp/RtmptbzDyf/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:09:36.1935106Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:09:36.1935568Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:09:36.1935976Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:09:36.1936596Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:09:36.1937529Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:09:36.1938595Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
